["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Outcome\n\nEvidence on a tree store is an Entity Runtime observation at the artifact's current revision:\nit does not advance the revision, and evidence on one branch with a move on another does not\nfork the artifact (design § 4.1, review N7).\n\n## Why it is not built yet\n\nEntity Runtime 0.21.0 has `BatchAction::Observe` and `Store::observe`, and an observation leaves\nthe revision unchanged, but `walk_branches` (`entity-store/src/asynchronous/verify.rs`) counts\nevery record without a successor as a head, observations included. Measured: an observation on\none branch and a move on another report the artifact as forked after the merge. The Entity\nRuntime change that makes only decisions heads is in progress; this story follows its release.\n\nSwitching also changes what `move`, `explain` and `history` read, since evidence counts come\nfrom the packed `document` events today.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"record-evidence","kind":"test_result","reference":"git:beyond10x/aep@45d7547fe","source":"aep-backend-eventlog and aep-cli: 704 passed; clippy and fmt clean; adversary fixes mutation-checked","target":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169"},"changed":{},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790273858000,"causation":"cmd-child-a55e4405e20bba69d1916f515e995aaac162f3001b5f7061dcedc25ce45e574f","correlation":"protocol-artifact-evidence","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169@3#0~45606c7e6d3c99a1","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-24T18:17:38Z"},"revision":3,"to_state":"active","type":"aep.evidence.record/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266783934,"id":"ent-f0c60685652ee7b2e99484a8d911f169","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/evidence-is-an-observation-on-a-tree-store","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":3,"t